OL,3,GNEWSA'I paid thousands to a company for
OL,4,Ahealthcare jobs that didn't
OL,5,Amaterialise'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA company has been accused of promising
OL,8,Fjobs in the healthcare sector which
OL,9,Fnever materialised, leaving people
OL,10,Fthousands of pounds out of pocket.
OL,12,FRegistered in 2025, Synetal Solutions
OL,13,FLtd says it offers career-focused
OL,14,Ftraining programmes in the healthcare
OL,15,Fand IT sectors.
OL,17,FBut the BBC has spoken to a number of
OL,18,Fpeople who claim they were promised
OL,19,Ftraining and support to secure
OL,20,Fsponsored healthcare jobs that never
OL,21,Fbecame available to apply for.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
