OL,3,GNEWSA'I paid thousands to a company for
OL,4,Ahealthcare jobs that didn't
OL,5,Amaterialise'
OL,6,
OL,7,FLondon Citizens Advice says it has seen
OL,8,Fan increase in recruitment-related
OL,9,Fscams since the government stopped
OL,10,Foverseas recruitment for care workers.
OL,11,FThe charity described the firm's
OL,12,Fpractices as "unethical".
